## Why This Is Asked
Explores practical data correctness under retries in a CNPA stack.

## Key Concepts
- Idempotent endpoints, Redis dedupe with TTL
- PostgreSQL upsert on a unique signup_id
- Kafka transactional writes and idempotent producer
- End-to-end verification under load

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: dedupe with Redis before DB write
if (redis.setnx('signup:'+signup_id, '1')) {
  redis.expire('signup:'+signup_id, 86400);
  // write to DB and publish
} else {
  // duplicate detected
  return 200;
}
```

